A.b5("-> only request, task shows workflow completion, on top of their forms. it consists of a simple bar declining steps with a list of parrallel subtask depending on step.")
A.b5("-> grey color define not reached step, vivid color step is done or currently doing, icons in subtask will give you its current state (done or doing). task can show you a optionnal hub under main workflow, by this you can choose wich are the next step to launch.")
